				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1499,
				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Optimize IPC handling and enable diagnostic tracing\n\nEnable full diagnostic tracing by setting the `Trace` configuration in `Info.plist` to `all`.\n\nRefactor `Entry.rs` to implement robust TTY detection logic. Check `TERM_PROGRAM` or verify `TERM` is not `dumb`/`unknown` before attempting shell environment enhancement or loading `.env.Land` files, ensuring these operations are skipped when the binary is launched from an interactive terminal that already provides the correct environment.\n\nOptimize the `mountain_ipc_invoke` handler in `WindServiceHandlers` by introducing a high-frequency command filter. Identify silent commands (e.g., `logger:*`, `file:watch`, `storage` events) to:\n- Skip expensive OTLP span creation and PostHog capture events\n- Avoid Echo scheduler submission for known no-ops, returning `Value::Null` immediately\n- Suppress verbose per-call logging\n\nThis significantly reduces CPU overhead and log noise during boot and high-frequency UI updates driven by VS Code workbench services.",
			"SHA": "ee7a36e9f45ce5ec94d67b9caf025ac5b2db4e72"
		}
